  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLIMATE CHANGE RESILIENCE&amp;POVERTY REDUCTION FOUNDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to strengthen grassroots governance structures in the remote Evurore Ward,  Embu County by empowering vulnerable  women and youth to meaningfully participate in local decision-making, through structured, inclusive participatory forums. Targeting 300 direct beneficiaries, the initiative will enhance civic engagement, accountability, and community-driven development by building the leadership capacity of traditionally marginalized groups. The project is keen on meaningful engagement of women and youth, which will contribute to Ireland&#x2019;s commitment to leave no one behind and reach the furthest behind first</narrative>
  </description>
